<title>MOLDOVA: MOLDOVA TRADE GAP NARROWED TO 29.9 MLN IN JAN.</title>
<headline>MOLDOVA TRADE GAP NARROWED TO 29.9 MLN IN JAN.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moldova's foreign trade</p>
<p>deficit narrowed to 29.9 million in January 1997 from 31.2</p>
<p>million in January 1996, an official from the State Statistics</p>
<p>Department told Reuters.</p>
<p> MOLDOVAN FOREIGN TRADE		 Jan '97	 Jan '96</p>
<p>    Exports				   47.1	    42.4</p>
<p>    Imports				   77.0	    73.6</p>
<p>    Balance				  -29.9	   -31.2</p>
<p>NOTE - figures in millions of dollars. In 1996 the total</p>
<p>foreign trade deficit amounted to 277.6 million after 80.6</p>
<p>million in 1995.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
